OL,3,GNEWSACollege tutor crowned Britain's
OL,4,Afastest bricklayer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bricklayer has been crowned the
OL,7,Ffastest in Britain after coming top in
OL,8,Fa national competition.
OL,10,FDale Wherton, who teaches at West
OL,11,FNottinghamshire College's Station Park
OL,12,Fcampus in Kirkby-in-Ashfield, claimed
OL,13,Fthe title at the Super Trowel final at
OL,14,FHertfordshire County Showground. He
OL,15,Flaid 859 bricks in one hour earlier
OL,16,Fthis month.
OL,18,FCompetitors were tested not only on the
OL,19,Fnumber of bricks they could lay in one
OL,20,Fhour, but also on the accuracy,
OL,21,Fconsistency and overall quality of
OL,22,Ftheir workmanship, organisers said.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
