OL,3,GNEWSACollege tutor crowned Britain's
OL,4,Afastest bricklayer
OL,5,
OL,6,FWherton, from Derby, will now represent
OL,7,FBritain at the Bricklayer 500
OL,8,Finternational championships in Las
OL,9,FVegas in January 2027.
